{"id":"cd4abe4b1f57f7bb","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-expressible-vs-representable.md","title":"Expressible vs Representable","display":"prop-expressible-vs-representable — Expressible vs Representable","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-expressible-vs-representable","aliases":["92-prop-expressible-vs-representable"],"display":"prop-expressible-vs-representable — Expressible vs Representable","depends_on":["[[92-df-expressible]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-sound-system]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 58–59；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 75–76、114）","source_status":"本地旧 Rep_G 的语义推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-expressible-vs-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-expressible-vs-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-expressible-vs-representable — Expressible vs Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d5d7c9d78e08590\" href=\"?note=6d5d7c9d78e08590\" title=\"92-df-expressible\">92-df-expressible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 58–59；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 75–76、114）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地旧 Rep_G 的语义推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Express}_G,\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Express}_G,\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (expressibility and numeralwise representability predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}\\)</span> (arithmetic-soundness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressible\\text{-}vs\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Express}_G(A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressible\\text{-}vs\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Express}_G(A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Express}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Express}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可表达</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可表示</li>\n<li>可表达是标准模型中的语义定义；可表示要求<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>逐个证明正确的正、负numeral实例</li>\n<li>从可表示推出可表达需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的算术可靠性，否则系统可能证明错误实例</li>\n<li>反向蕴涵一般不成立：语义上定义一个集合，并不保证给定理论能证明每个正确实例</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里旧 Rep_G 是正负实例可证的数码定义，Sound 保证该同一公式标准模型正确。原书普通表示只约束可证性，不能把本断言不加区别地套在 SRep 上；可用另一公式表达同一集合和该见证本身语义正确也应区别。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 58–59；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 75–76、114）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-expressible","status":"resolved","id":"6d5d7c9d78e08590","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-expressible]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}$ (arithmetic-soundness predicate, see [[92-df-sound-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Express}_G,\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressible\\text{-}vs\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Express}_G(A)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Express}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1790,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-336","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-expressible-vs-representable]]"}],"outgoing":["6d5d7c9d78e08590","d9d845f6cd765d21","d76d3a84b374975c"]}